    <string name="attribution_derived">The day stem-branch, clash and sha, moon phase, solar terms, festivals, fortune, suitable and unsuitable activities and auspicious hours are derived by this app from traditional rules or astronomical formulas; they are not provided by the Central Weather Administration. The fortune, 宜忌 and 吉時 follow a simplified reading of the 建除 and 黃道黑道 systems, so a published almanac may differ; they are folk tradition, not prediction.</string>
